{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 44-1. Nīvaraṇaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-43-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-43a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21932.895956032426\">6:05:32</span> 1. Nonīvaraṇaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nonīvaraṇo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21944.237004965667\">6:05:44</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21949.150284814034\">6:05:49</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21954.2392770515\">6:05:54</span> 3. Nīvaraṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nīvaraṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nonīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nīvaraṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo akusalo ca nonīvaraṇo akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-43a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21984.082219951364\">6:06:24</span> 4. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-4</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21987.913244123025\">6:06:27</span> 5. Nīvaraṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchānīvaraṇaṃ uddhaccanīvaraṇaṃ paṭicca avijjānīvaraṇaṃ. (1) ^7-43a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22002.87072905722\">6:06:42</span> Nonīvaraṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate uddhaccasahagate khandhe paṭicca avijjānīvaraṇaṃ. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22017.882604211714\">6:06:57</span> Nīvaraṇañca nonīvaraṇañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchānīvaraṇañca uddhaccanīvaraṇañca sampayuttake ca khandhe paṭicca avijjānīvaraṇaṃ. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22036.269329105857\">6:07:16</span> 6. Nahetuyā tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava…pe… nakamme tīṇi…pe… navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22044.98966406294\">6:07:24</span> (Sahajātavārepi… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha nava.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22050.05611869959\">6:07:30</span> 7. Nīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo nīvaraṇassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22057.2009358312\">6:07:37</span> 8. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… āsevane nava, kamme āhāre indriye jhāne magge tīṇi, sampayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22063.318342154496\">6:07:43</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22068.251304177382\">6:07:48</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22071.67631205436\">6:07:51</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22075.71586385409\">6:07:55</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22089.330249957085\">6:08:09</span> 9. Nonīvaraṇaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nonīvaraṇo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22101.430158676703\">6:08:21</span> 10. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43a-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22106.695642988558\">6:08:26</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 45-1. Nīvaraṇiyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-43b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-43c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22111.546491040055\">6:08:31</span> 11. Nīvaraṇiyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-43c-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22120.658490011443\">6:08:40</span> Anīvaraṇiyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anīvaraṇiyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22128.033453879838\">6:08:48</span> 12. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43c-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22132.79419\">6:08:52</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22137.987250902726\">6:08:57</span> 13. Nīvaraṇiyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43c-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22146.900314876977\">6:09:06</span> 14. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43c-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22152.747218719618\">6:09:12</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22157.10195402003\">6:09:17</span> 15. Nīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-43c-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22166.74793493992\">6:09:26</span> Anīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anīvaraṇiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22175.76724988556\">6:09:35</span> Nīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākatañca anīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22187.585476128745\">6:09:47</span> 16. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… āsevane ekaṃ…pe… vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.) ^7-43c-16</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 46-1. Nīvaraṇasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-43d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-43e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22198.963924951364\">6:09:58</span> 17. Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43e-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22211.241050705314\">6:10:11</span> 18. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43e-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22216.51333108011\">6:10:16</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22221.41985491989\">6:10:21</span> 19. Nīvaraṇasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43e-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22230.09980688556\">6:10:30</span> 20. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43e-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22235.349949234605\">6:10:35</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22241.343861211717\">6:10:41</span> 21. Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43e-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22250.573196879835\">6:10:50</span> 22. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43e-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22255.4537237797\">6:10:55</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 47-1. Nīvaraṇanīvaraṇiyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-43f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-43g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22260.44778302575\">6:11:00</span> 23. Nīvaraṇiyañceva no ca nīvaraṇaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo ceva no ca nīvaraṇo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43g-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22270.769962034334\">6:11:10</span> 24. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43g-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22275.41557102003\">6:11:15</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22302.264710109102\">6:11:42</span> 25. Nīvaraṇañceva nīvaraṇiyañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo ceva nīvaraṇiyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-43g-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22318.30330599428\">6:11:58</span> Nīvaraṇiyañceva no ca nīvaraṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo ceva no ca nīvaraṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>Nīvaraṇañceva nīvaraṇiyaṃ akusalañca nīvaraṇiyañceva no ca nīvaraṇaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo ca nīvaraṇiyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22334.176315092314\">6:12:14</span> 26. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43g-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22340.321842985315\">6:12:20</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha nava.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22344.732076117492\">6:12:24</span> 27. Nīvaraṇiyañceva no ca nīvaraṇaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇiyo ceva no ca nīvaraṇo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43g-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22357.912369002097\">6:12:37</span> 28. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43g-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22363.0151830021\">6:12:43</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 48-1. Nīvaraṇanīvaraṇasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-43h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-43i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22368.079642962235\">6:12:48</span> 29. Nīvaraṇañceva nīvaraṇasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo ceva nīvaraṇasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43i-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22381.529756951746\">6:13:01</span> 30. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43i-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22385.556753136374\">6:13:05</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha nava.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 49-1. Nīvaraṇavippayuttanīvaraṇiyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-43j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-43k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22390.414503199318\">6:13:10</span> 31. Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ nīvaraṇiyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto nīvaraṇiyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-43k-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22402.489817861526\">6:13:22</span> Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ anīvaraṇiyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto anīvaraṇiyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22414.723584842643\">6:13:34</span> 32. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43k-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22418.78457916155\">6:13:38</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22425.500879018884\">6:13:45</span> 33. Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ nīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto nīvaraṇiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-43k-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22440.09459398741\">6:14:00</span> Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ anīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto anīvaraṇiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22454.366710983213\">6:14:14</span> Nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ nīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākatañca nīvaraṇavippayuttaṃ anīvaraṇiyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇavippayutto nīvaraṇiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22471.577665909783\">6:14:31</span> 34. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… vipāke pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-43k-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22476.465166874113\">6:14:36</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Nīvaraṇagocchakakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":22478.45904}